# G7 (mmnto-ai/totem-strategy#1154, spec `.totem/specs/seed20-apparatus.md`): the
# lowered policy and its glob table are PUBLISHED under `artifacts/lowered/<pkg>/`
# so T3 can audit the lowering from the repository at the pin. The BUILD tree
# (`rego/build/`, above) stays ignored — the published copy is the auditable one.
# Stated explicitly rather than relied on: nothing above matches this path today
# (`git check-ignore -v` reports no rule), and this line keeps it that way if a
# broader `artifacts/`-shaped ignore is ever added here.
!artifacts/lowered/
